## AI Skills Navigator Playlists for the Premier League Hack

Use these curated AI Skills Navigator playlists to build the skills you’ll need for the Premier League Hack. Whether you’re new to GitHub Copilot, exploring Azure AI Foundry, or building agentic workflows with data, these learning paths will help you get ready to design, prototype, and ship AI-powered solutions.

| Playlist | What you’ll learn |
|---|---|
| [GitHub Copilot](https://aka.ms/asn/ghcopilot) | Use GitHub Copilot to accelerate coding, debugging, and solution development. |
| [Azure AI Foundry](https://aka.ms/asn/foundry) | Build, evaluate, and manage AI apps using Azure AI Foundry. |
| [Foundry Agents](https://aka.ms/asn/foundryagents) | Create AI agents that can reason, use tools, and complete tasks. |
| [Agentic Workflows](https://aka.ms/asn/agenticworkflows) | Design multi-step AI workflows that combine models, data, and automation. |
| [Data](https://aka.ms/asn/data) | Work with data as the foundation for impactful AI experiences. |

Start with the playlist that best matches your role or project idea, then explore the others as your hack solution evolves. These resources will help you move from idea to working prototype with confidence.
